      "content": "thanks that makes sense. so it's basically just pandas being paranoid about whether i'm changing the original data or just a temporary slice. is there any way to just silence the warning if i know what im doing and i dont care about the copy vs view thing? i dont want my output cluttered with warnings if the code is actually working fine.",
